# Downloaded Linux binaries for the offline install path (fetch-vendor.ps1).
# ~24 MB of release tarballs - fetched on demand, not source, so not committed.
# For an air-gapped server: clone the repo there, then copy bootstrap/vendor/
# across separately and run ./install-linux.sh --offline
bootstrap/vendor/*
!bootstrap/vendor/.gitkeep

